==={{CoH|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Stub|CoH}}
Fairies can be found around [[Fairy Fountain]]s in [[Dungeon]]s. They move one tile every beat, and will restore eight [[Heart]]s to a hero's [[Life Gauge]] if walked into. If kept in a [[Bottle]], Fairies will also provide eight Hearts when the holder's Life Gauge is fully depleted.<ref name="CoH Inventory"/> Another variety known as a [[Bomb Fairy]] also appears. When allowed to walk into the heroes, Bomb Fairies will heal them, but when damaged, they explode.
